      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "guäth in ci Yecu wä wi̱i̱ Pa̱a̱m Ɔ-lip.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7:53—8:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kä ruaacni Kuɔth tëë wal thilɛ kɛn ciök ti̱ti̱ thi̱n. Kä ci tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn ɛ gɔ̱r guäth mi dɔ̱diɛn.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ runwaŋ ɛlɔ̱ŋ cuɛ rɔ nyɔk kɛ ben luaak Kuɔth. Kä cu nɛy diaal ben kä jɛ, kä cuɛ nyuur, kä cuɛ tok kɛ mi ŋi̱i̱cɛ kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu gɔa̱a̱r ŋuɔ̱t ni kɛnɛ ji̱ Pa-ri-thii ciek mi ca käp dho̱m nöŋ, kä cukɛ jɛ la̱th nhiamdiɛn diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ Yecu jiök i̱, “Ŋi̱i̱c, ɛn ciek ɛmɛ ca jɛ käp dho̱m. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ ciaaŋ ŋuɔ̱tni ci Muthɛ jɛ la̱t kɔ ɛn ɣöö ba ciek mi ce̱tkɛ nɛ bök kɛ pääm. Ɛn täämɛ ɛ ji̱n i̱di?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lat kɛn nɛmɛ kɛ ɣöö ɣɔ̱n kɛn ni jɛ, kɛ ɣöö derɛ tekɛ mi ba gɔny ni jɛ. Cu Yecu rɔ goŋ, kä cuɛ piny gɔ̱r kɛ yiatdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min ŋotkɛ kɛ mi thiëckɛ jɛ, cuɛ rɔ jiëc cuɔ̱ŋ, kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “A ramɔ thil duer ɔ rɛydun bo̱k jɛ kɛ päm kɛ nhiam.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ rɔ lɛni goŋ, kä cuɛ lɛni gɔ̱a̱r piny kɛ yiatdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë cikɛ ruacdɛ liŋ, cukɛ jiɛɛn kɛ̈l kɛ̈ɛ̈li, tookɛ ni kä di̱t cu mäni ŋuɛ̈tni, kä cu Yecu duɔth kärɔa, kä te ciek cuŋä nhiamdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu rɔ jiac nhial, kä cuɛ ciek jiök i̱, “Ciek, kä naath anikä? Cɛ thil ram mi kuɛth ji̱ dui̱rä?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ciek ɛ loc i̱, “Thilɛ raan, kuäär.” Kä cu Yecu wee i̱, “Kä /cä ji̱ bi kuɛ̈th dui̱rä bä. Kä wër, /cu duer lɛ nyɔk kɛ lätni.”]",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yecu ɛ buay ɣɔaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu lɛni ruac kɛ kɛ, wëë i̱, “Ɛ ɣän buay ɣɔaa. Kä ram mi guur ɣä /cɛ bi ja̱l rɛy muɔ̱th, bɛ tekɛ buay teekä.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Jɔ̱ɔ̱n 9:5, Mɛ̈t 5:14-16.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ji̱ Pa-ri-thii jɛ jiök i̱, “Ji̱n latdi ruac nenä kɛ kui̱du kärɔa, /ci ruac nenädu a thuɔ̱k.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yecu ɛ loc i̱, “A cäŋ latdä ruac nenädä kɛ kui̱dä, nëndä ɛ thuɔ̱k, kɛ ɣöö ŋa̱cä gua̱a̱th in ba̱a̱ thi̱n, kä ŋa̱cä gua̱a̱th in wa̱a̱ thi̱n. Duundɛ ɣöö kui̱c yɛn gua̱a̱th in ba̱a̱ thi̱n, kä kui̱c yɛn gua̱a̱th in wa̱a̱ thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luk yɛn naath kɛ ciaaŋ nath, kä thilɛ ram mi luɔ̱kä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ŋotdɛ bä cäŋɛ mi luɔ̱kä naath, lukdä ɛ cuɔ̱ɔ̱ŋ, kɛ ɣöö /ciɛ ɣän kärɔa ɛnɔ luk naath ɔ, ɛ ɣän kɔnɛ Gua̱a̱r ëë jäk ɣä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ca jɛ gɔ̱r rɛy ŋuɔ̱tnikun ɛn ɣöö ɛ ruac nenä nɛɛni da̱ŋ rɛw la thuɔ̱k ɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän cä ruac nenä lat kɛ kui̱dä, kä ci Gua̱a̱r ëë jäk ɣä ruac nenä lat kɛ kui̱dä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ cukɛ jɛ thiec i̱, “Jɛn a nikä ɛn Guur?” Kä cu Yecu jɛ loc i̱, “Kui̱c yɛn ɣä, kä kui̱c yɛn Gua̱a̱r. Duŋ mi ŋäc yɛn ɣä, dërɛ Gua̱a̱r ŋa̱c bä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ ruaacni ti̱ti̱ lat guäth ëë ŋi̱i̱cɛ naath rɛy luaak Kuɔth guäth yio̱o̱ni, kä cuɛ thil ram mi cu jɛ yiɛn, kɛ ɣöö ŋot gua̱a̱thdɛ /kenɛ ni cop.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lat Yecu kɛ lia̱a̱dɛ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yecu kɛ lɛni jiök i̱, “Ɣän jiayä, bia ɣä go̱r, kä bia li̱w kɛ dueerkun. Kä gua̱a̱th in wa̱a̱ thi̱n, /cia bi ben thi̱n.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Juudh wee i̱, “A bɛ rɔɔdɛ ku wä näk? Kä ɛ jɛn min lotdɛ min wëë i̱, ‘Gua̱a̱th in wa̱a̱ thi̱n, /cia bi ben thi̱n’?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Kɛ yɛn ji̱ piɛny ɛmɛ, kä ɛ ɣän raan nhial, kä kɛ yɛn ji̱ ɣɔaa ɛmɛ, /ciɛ ɣän raan ɣɔaa ɛmɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cä la̱r yɛ ɛn ɣöö bia li̱w rɛy dueerikun, kä bi yɛn li̱w rɛy dueerikun ɛ ni mi bi yɛn ɛ ŋäth, i̱ ɛ jɛn ɣän.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ jɛ thiec i̱, “Ɛ ji̱n ŋa?” Cu Yecu kɛ loc i̱, “Ɛ ɣän ram min ci rɔ la̱r yɛ ni kɛ nhiam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän ta̱a̱ kɛ ti ŋuan ti bä lat kɛ kui̱dun, kä ta̱a̱ kɛ ti ŋuan ti bä yɛ kuɛth kɛ kui̱diɛn, kä ram ëë jäk ɣä ɛ thuɔ̱k, kä cä wi̱c muɔ̱ɔ̱n la̱t min cä liŋ kä jɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /kenɛ wä lɔɔcdiɛn ɛn ɣöö ruacɛ kɛ kɛ kui̱ Gua̱a̱r in te nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä inɔ cu Yecu wee i̱, “Mi wä yɛn Gat Ran wä kap nhial, bi yɛn ɛ cu ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö ɛ jɛn ɣän, kä thilɛ mi cä la̱t kɛ lua̱ŋdä ɣän kärɔa, duundɛ ɣöö latdä ti̱ti̱ ce̱tkɛ min ci Gua̱a̱r ɛ nyuɔ̱th ɣä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä te ram ëë jäk ɣä kɛ ɣä kɛɛl, kä /kenɛ ɣä ba̱ny piny ɣän kärɔa kɛ ɣöö la la̱tdä ni ŋɔak tin tɛ̈thkɛ lɔcdɛ gua̱thni diaal.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Min cɛ ruac ɛmɔ lat, cu nɛy ti ŋuan ɛ ŋäth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thuɔ̱k bɛ ji̱ jakä lɔr",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yecu ji̱ Juudh tin ŋa̱thkɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Mi wä yɛn kɛ wä nhiam kɛ nhök ruacdä, lapɛ ji̱ kɔaarä pa̱ny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bia thuɔ̱k ŋa̱c, kä bi thuɔ̱k yɛ jakä cieŋ alɔr.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ jɛ loc i̱, “Kɛ kɔn gaat A-bɛ-ram, kä /ka̱n kɔ met pɛc ɛ raan. Kä ɛ ŋu deri jɛ lar ɔ, ɛn ɣöö bä yɛ jakä cieŋ a lɔr?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu kɛ loc i̱, “Ɛpuc, ɛpuc, ɣän la̱rä jɛ yɛ, Nɛy diaal tin duerkɛ dueer kɛ kuaany dueeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Ci kuany lɛ te rɛy gɔaal a wee wä, ɛ jɛn gat gɔaal min te thi̱n a thil pek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi lony Gat Kuɔth yɛ, bia cieŋ ɛ lɔr ciaaŋdun pa̱ny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän ŋa̱cä jɛ ɛn ɣöö lapɛ gaat A-bɛ-ram, kä go̱o̱r yɛn näkdä, kɛ ɣöö /ci ruaacnikä gua̱a̱th jek rɛy lo̱cnikun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän ruacä kɛ min cä nɛn kä Gua̱a̱r, kä lät yɛn ni min cia liŋ kä Gua̱ndan.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yecu kɛnɛ A-bɛ-ram gua̱n jiäkni kiɛ Kuɔth?",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ jɛ loc i̱, “A-bɛ-ram ɛ jɛn gua̱a̱ra.” Cu Yecu kɛ jiök i̱, “Mi lapɛ gaat A-bɛ-ram dee yɛn la̱t ni min ci A-bɛ-ram ɛ la̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ go̱o̱r yɛn näkdä, ɣän ram in ci yɛ la̱t thuɔ̱k in cä liŋ kä Kuoth. Mɛmɛ /ciɛ mi ci A-bɛ-ram ɛ la̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lät yɛn ni min ci guurun ɛ la̱t.” Cukɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “/Ka̱nkɔ di̱eth läkä, ta̱kɔ kɛ Gua̱a̱ra kɛl, min la Kuoth.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu kɛ jiök i̱, “Duŋ mi guurun ɛ jɛn Kuoth dee yɛn ɣä nhɔk, kɛ ɣöö, ɣän ba̱a̱ kä jɛ. /Ka̱n ben kɛ wi̱cdä, ɛ jɛn jäk ɣä mɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛŋu mɔ /ci min latdä cup lo̱cnikun ɔ? Ɛ ɣöö cia thil lua̱ŋ kɛ li̱eŋ ruacdä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ yɛn gaat guurun ni gua̱n jiäkni, kä cia nhɔk ni ɣöö bia la̱t ni tin go̱o̱r guurun kɛ. Ɛ luuc nath ni tukä ɣɔaa, kä thilɛ jɛ thuɔ̱k, kɛ ɣöö thilɛ thuɔ̱k rɛydɛ. Kä jɛn la ruacɛ, kɛ ciaaŋdɛ pa̱ny, kɛ ɣöö ɛ gua̱n kacä, kä ɛ gua̱n ka̱a̱cni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ ɣöö latdä ni thuɔ̱k /ci yɛn ɣä ŋäth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛŋa kä yɛ bi ɣä kuëth duer ɔ? Mi latdä thuɔ̱k, kä ɛŋu /ci yɛn ɣä ŋäth? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jɛn min la raan Kuɔth liŋɛ ruaacni Kuɔth. Luɔt kä min /ci yɛn ɛ liŋ nikɛ ɛ ɣöö /cia bä kä Kuoth.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Di̱t ni Yecu kä A-bɛ-ram",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ji̱ Juudh ɛ loc i̱, “/Ciɛ thuɔ̱k ɛn ɣöö larkɔ jɛ ɛn ɣöö ɛ ji̱n raan Tha-mɛ-ria, kä ti kɛ yiëë mi jiääk?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu kɛ loc i̱, “Thilɛ ɣä yiëë mi jiääk, luɔ̱thä Gua̱a̱r, kä /ci yɛn ɣä luth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /cä go̱r ni liakdä, tëëkɛ ram mi go̱o̱r jɛ, kä ɛ jɛn kuäär luɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛpuc, ɛpuc, ɣän la̱rä jɛ yɛ, ram mi käp ruacdä, /cɛ lia̱a̱ bi met nɛn.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ji̱ Juudh ɛ jiök i̱, “Täämɛ ŋa̱ckɔ jɛ ɛn ɣöö ti̱i̱ kɛ yiëë mi jiääk. Ci A-bɛ-ram li̱w amäni göök, kä laari jɛ i̱, ‘Mi tëë kɛ ram mi kääp ruacdä, /cɛ lia̱a̱ bi met nɛn.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji̱n lenyi gua̱a̱ra gua̱ndɔɔŋda ni A-bɛ-ram ëë ci li̱w? Kä ci göök li̱w bä! Kä ku lɛ wee i̱ ɛ ji̱n ŋa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu jɛ loc i̱, “Mi puanyä rɔɔdä, thilɛ puɔnydä luɔt. Ɛ Gua̱a̱r ɛn ni puɔny ɣä, min laar yɛnɛ i̱, ‘Ɛ Kuothda’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /ken yɛn ɛ ŋa̱c, kä ɣän ŋa̱cä jɛ. Mi cä wee i̱, ‘Ɣän kuecä jɛ’, dee ɣän a gua̱n kacä ce̱tkɛ yɛ. Kä ɣän ŋa̱cä jɛ pa̱ny, kä ka̱pä rieetkɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu gua̱ndɔɔŋdun ni A-bɛ-ram lɔcdɛ tɛɛth kɛ ɣöö derɛ cäŋdä nɛn. Kä cuɛ jɛ nɛn, kä cu lɔcdɛ tɛɛth.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Juudh ɛ jiök i̱, “/Ken runku ni a jiɛn dhieec, kä ci A-bɛ-ram nɛn?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yecu kɛ jiök i̱, “Ɛpuc, ɛpuc, ɣän la̱rä jɛ yɛ, mëë ŋot A-bɛ-ram ɛ /ka̱n ɛ ni dap, ta̱a̱ wa̱nɔ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛnɔ cukɛ pääm kuany kɛ ɣöö bikɛ jɛ bök, kä cu Yecu rɔ ric kɛ kam naath, kä cuɛ wä raar rɛy luaak Kuɔth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.59"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
